WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.807
Meet the little AI team inside your Mac.

00:00:02.857 --> 00:00:04.745
Nemotron knows who's talking.

00:00:04.795 --> 00:00:07.128
Qwen3-ASR writes it down.

00:00:07.178 --> 00:00:09.347
Qwen3.5 sums it up.

00:00:09.397 --> 00:00:11.267
Harrier searches by meaning.

00:00:11.317 --> 00:00:14.420
Apple Vision reads your screen, if you opt in.

00:00:14.470 --> 00:00:17.456
LFM2.5 finishes your sentences.

00:00:17.506 --> 00:00:20.718
All under seven gigabytes, running locally.

00:00:20.768 --> 00:00:23.400
LokalBot. Free and open source.
